        "TileImage": "$($repository 4665dab1-e099-438b-8419-f80d3106ec33).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome to Miami.\r\rOur client, a wealthy technology mogul, has requested the agency&apos;s help in settling an old score.\r\rFormerly a keen racecar driver, the client was scarred in an incident caused by the neglect of one of his mechanics and exacerbated by the ill-preparedness of the attending fire crew. Upon discovering that the two men responsible will be working at the Innovation Race, he believes that today would be the perfect  opportunity for some poetic justice.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare.",
